{"results":[{"url":"https://sitesetu.app/rera/maharashtra/mumbai/oberoi-three-sixty-west-360","title":"Oberoi Three Sixty West (360) — RERA Status & Details","raw_content":"# Oberoi Three Sixty West (360) (RERA P51900012115): price, possession and the verified record\n\n**Oberoi Three Sixty West (360)** is a 1.58-acre, 284-unit  project by Oberoi Realty at Worli, South Mumbai, registered with MahaRERA as **P51900012115** and listed at **Rs 45 Cr - Rs 99 Cr+**. Possession is the one thing the record does not agree on: the promoter’s own filing declares **31 Dec 2021**, the authority’s current record shows **30 Jun 2022**, and marketing says **Jun 2022**.\n\n## Is Oberoi Three Sixty West (360) RERA approved?\n\nYes. It is registered with MahaRERA under **P51900012115**, covering 1.58 acres with 284 residential units and 6 recorded approvals.\n\nSource: MahaRERA registration certificate P51900012115.\n\n## When is possession at Oberoi Three Sixty West (360)?\n\nThere are **3 different dates on record**. The promoter committed to **31 Dec 2021** in its own RERA filing. The authority’s current public record shows **30 Jun 2022**. Marketing says **Jun 2022**.\n\n!None of these is an occupancy certificate. A declared completion date is what the promoter filed, not proof of delivery.\n\nSource: the promoter's RERA filing (Form REP-I) and the authority's registered-project index.\n\n## What is the price of Oberoi Three Sixty West (360)?\n\nPublicly listed at **Rs 45 Cr - Rs 99 Cr+**. No dated, unit-specific price list was sourced against this registration, so treat the band as indicative rather than an offer.\n\n### Amenities on record\n\nSource: the filed unit schedule. Price band from public listings; not promoter-confirmed.\n\n## Who is the developer of Oberoi Three Sixty West (360)?\n\nThe promoter on record is **Oasis Realty**, marketed as Oberoi Realty.\n\nSource: the authority's promoter disclosure and the filed financial schedule.\n\n## Is it safe to buy in Oberoi Three Sixty West (360)?\n\nThe registration itself is sound — identity, scope and phase all check out. 3 things are still open, and the completion date is the one field two authority sources disagree on. Resolve that before you pay.\n\nSource: Site Setu agent-reviewed dossier, 2026-07-30. Record-quality assessment, not investment advice.\n\n## The verified record behind this page\n\nEvery figure above comes from a document filed with MahaRERA. This is the audit that produced them — 5 dimensions assessed, every fact carrying its own confidence.\n\n### Record review\n\nAgent-reviewed 2026-07-30 · 9 facts checked · 5 dimensions · **1 unresolved conflict**\n\nSource: Retained canonical MahaRERA-derived observations, project context and Site Setu review\n\n## The same filings, as a working project plan\n\nA RERA filing already contains a programme, a cost plan, an approvals register and a drawing register — just locked inside PDFs. This is that filing rendered as a live Site Setu workspace, with nothing added.\n\n### Overview\n\nOberoi Three Sixty West (360)\n\n#### Record timeline\n\n#### Project card\n\nThis is a read-only view built from the filing. In your own workspace these become live — progress, spend and inventory update as your site team reports them.\n\nEvery value read from this project’s own filing. Where the record publishes nothing — construction progress, collections, sold inventory — the workspace shows an empty column rather than an invented number.\n\n## Other registered projects nearby\n\nSame corridor, same authority. Compared on what is filed, not on what is advertised.\n\n| Project | Promoter | Price | Possession |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Oberoi Three Sixty West (360) | Oberoi Realty | Rs 45 Cr - Rs 99 Cr+ | 30 Jun 2022 |\n| [Oberoi Elysian](/rera/maharashtra/mumbai/oberoi-elysian) | Oberoi Realty | Starting ~Rs 5.6 Cr (3 BHK) to Rs 16+ Cr (large 4 BHK) | 2027-06-30 |\n| [Lodha Sea Face](/rera/maharashtra/mumbai/lodha-sea-face) | Lodha Developers Limited (formerly Macrotech Developers Limited) | 58.91 Cr - 98.61 Cr (some transactions up to Rs 187 Cr) | 2029-02-28 |\n| [Oceanic](/rera/maharashtra/mumbai/oceanic-bandra) | Oberoi Realty Limited | On request | 2030-12-31 |\n| [OMKAR CHS LTD](/rera/maharashtra/mumbai/omkar-chs-ltd) | LAKSHMI BUILDERS AND DEVELOPERS | On request — contact developer / RERA-registered sales office | 2024-06-30 |\n| [Nahar Cayenne](/rera/maharashtra/mumbai/nahar-cayenne) | NAHAR BUILDERS LTD | On request — contact developer / RERA-registered sales office | 2018-02-28 |\n\n### Get the verified dossier\n\nOne PDF with every completion date and its source, the filed unit schedule, the escrow account and the exact questions to put to the authority.\n\nWe do not sell your details to brokers. One email, then only if this record changes.\n\nReviewed 2026-07-30 by the Site Setu research team.Retained canonical MahaRERA-derived observations, project context and Site Setu review\n\nConstruction Management App for Builders and Contractors in India. Manage tasks, materials, drawings, and site records from one mobile-first platform.\n\nQuestions? Email [hello@sitesetu.app](mailto:hello@sitesetu.app) or WhatsApp [+91 93104 92831](https://wa.me/919310492831?text=Hi%20Site%20Setu%2C%20I'd%20like%20to%20know%20more%20about%20the%20construction%20management%20app%20and%20a%20free%20pilot.)\n\n### Product\n\n### Workflows\n\n### Resources\n\n### Company\n\n### Legal\n\n### Compare\n\n### Top projects by city\n\n© 2026 Site Setu. All rights reserved.","images":[]},{"url":"https://realtypromoo.com/projects/oberoi-realty-worli-mumbai-project","title":"Oberoi Three Sixty West, Worli Mumbai — Price | RealtyPromoo","raw_content":"![Oberoi Realty Worli Mumbai Project — 4 BHK, 5 BHK — Worli — Mumbai](/images/projects/oberoi-realty-worli-mumbai-project.webp \"Oberoi Realty Worli Mumbai Project\")\n\nPhoto via Google Places\n\n# Oberoi Realty Worli Mumbai Project\n\n## About Oberoi Realty [Worli](/mumbai/worli) [Mumbai](/cities/mumbai) Project\n\nOberoi Three Sixty West is the headline residential project Oberoi Realty operates in Worli, Mumbai.\nThis ready-to-move landmark project offers an exclusive collection of spacious 4 BHK and 5 BHK luxury apartments. Spread across approximately 1.58 acres, the development features world-class architecture, premium interiors, and unmatched lifestyle services. With only 284 residences, Oberoi Three Sixty West represents exclusivity, elegance, and timeless luxury in Mumbai's prime real estate corridor.\nIt comprises two towers, joined at ground level by a podium. Tower B, the taller of the two, rises to 260 metres with 66 floors and Tower A rises to 255.6 metres with 52 floors. Tower A houses the Ritz-Carlton hotel; private residences are located in Tower B. The podium accommodates restaurants and ballrooms.\nThe complex was designed by Kohn Pedersen Fox and built by Samsung C&T — the same contractor behind [Dubai](/cities/dubai)'s Burj Khalifa.\n\n## Key Highlights\n\n## Location Advantages\n\nWorli sits on Mumbai's central coastline and is widely considered one of the city's most prestigious addresses.\nThe project is well-connected to Lower [Parel](/mumbai/parel), Nariman Point, and Bandra via major arterial roads, and the Bandra–Worli Sea Link facilitates quicker travel to the western suburbs.\nLower Parel's commercial cluster (One BKC, Kamala Mills, Phoenix Marketcity) is a 5-7 minute drive, and BKC is reachable in 12-15 minutes via the Sea Link outside peak hours.\nUpcoming metro access through Metro Line 3 (Colaba–Bandra–Seepz corridor)\nwill further reduce dependence on road traffic.\n\n**Honest concerns:** Worli sees severe peak-hour congestion on Annie [Besa](/nagpur/besa)nt Road, the Sea Link approach, and Worli Naka. Monsoons (June-September) can bring waterlogging at Worli Naka and Lotus Junction, though Three Sixty West's elevated podium insulates residents. The neighbourhood also has dense old-Mumbai pockets adjacent to ultra-luxury towers — a contrast some buyers from gated-suburb backgrounds find jarring.\n\n## What's Nearby — Schools, Hospitals, Malls\n\n| Category | Name | Distance | Drive Time |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| School (ICSE) | Podar International School, Worli | 1.2 km | 5 min |\n| School (ICSE/IGCSE) | Greenlawns School, Worli | 1.8 km | 7 min |\n| School (CBSE) | Dhirubhai Ambani International School, BKC | 7.5 km | 18 min |\n| School (IB) | D.Y. Patil International School, Worli | 2.5 km | 9 min |\n| Hospital (Multi-specialty) | Fortis S.L. Raheja Hospital, Mahim | 3.2 km | 10 min |\n| Hospital (Cancer) | Tata Memorial Hospital, Parel | 3.8 km | 12 min |\n| Hospital (General) | M.A. Podar Hospital, Worli | 1.5 km | 6 min |\n| Mall | High Street Phoenix & Palladium, Lower Parel | 2.4 km | 8 min |\n| Mall | Atria Mall, Worli | 1.9 km | 7 min |\n| Entertainment | Nehru Planetarium / NSCI Dome | 1.6 km | 6 min |\n| Restaurant Hub | Kamala Mills (Soho House, Hakkasan) | 2.7 km | 9 min |\n\n## Amenities\n\nThree Sixty West offers the best-in-class residential experience through Club 360. Two distinct zones, spread across two levels, have areas for sports, fitness, kids' activities and adventure at one end and leisure, lounging and relaxation at the other.\nThe Ritz-Carlton, Mumbai has 220 rooms, fine dining restaurants, a sea view bar, a spa and expansive banquet and other exclusive facilities all of which can be availed by residents for themselves or their guests.\n\n## Price & Configuration\n\n| Type | Carpet Area (sq.ft.) | Price (₹) | Approx. Price/Sq.ft. |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 BHK | 5,235 | ₹45 Cr – ₹78.5 Cr onwards | ₹86,000 – ₹1,50,000 |\n| 5 BHK | 6,651 | ₹57.17 Cr – ₹99 Cr onwards | ₹86,000 – ₹1,49,000 |\n\nOberoi Three Sixty West's average price is approximately ₹91,800/sq.ft. compared to Worli's locality average of ₹74,000/sq.ft.\nA 4 BHK is available at a starting price of ₹73 Cr while a 5 BHK is offered from ₹90 Cr onwards on the resale market.\nA 30:40:30 payment plan is available — 30% at booking, 40% on handover/renovation completion, and the remaining 30% on final possession\n, though\nmost direct primary sale units have historically required 100% upfront payment with maintenance roughly ₹3 lakhs per month\n. Apartments are delivered bareshell, so add ₹4,000–₹8,000/sq.ft. for fit-outs.\n\n## Construction Progress\n\nThree Sixty West is **complete and ready to move**.\nThe project is RERA registered under P51900012115 and possession began from 18 January 2024.\nBoth towers — the 52-floor Ritz-Carlton hotel tower and the 66-floor residential tower — are structurally complete with the podium operational.\nThe project has demonstrated strong buyer activity; as of February 2026, 15 residential transactions had been registered amounting to approximately ₹1,702 Cr. Earlier updates show that by November 2025, around 71 out of 284 launched units had already been booked across multiple apartment categories.\nNotably, Oberoi Realty's shareholders approved the acquisition of residential premises in Three Sixty West constructed by Oasis Realty for up to ₹4,000 crore — Oberoi Realty bought over 5 lakh square feet comprising 63 residential units\n, signalling deep confidence in the asset.\n\n## Investment Analysis\n\n## Pros and Cons\n\n**PROS:**\n\n**CONS:**\n\n## Who Should Buy This\n\n**Ideal for:** UHNI families seeking a trophy primary residence in South Mumbai, Indian and NRI promoters who want Ritz-Carlton-grade hotel services attached to their home, and family offices building long-horizon real estate portfolios where prestige and scarcity matter more than yield.\n\n**Not ideal for:** Yield-focused investors (rental returns are sub-1.5%), buyers needing turnkey furnished delivery (units are bareshell), and anyone whose work commute is concentrated in Andheri, [Powai](/mumbai/powai), or [Navi Mumbai](/cities/navi-mumbai) — Worli's location works for South Mumbai and BKC, less so for the eastern/northern suburbs.\n\n## FAQ — Frequently Asked Questions\n\n**Q: Is Oberoi Realty Worli Mumbai Project (Three Sixty West) RERA registered?**\n\nA: Yes.\nThree Sixty West is registered under MahaRERA registration number P51900012115\n, verifiable on the MahaRERA portal.\n\n**Q: What is the possession date for Three Sixty West Worli?**\n\nA: The project is ready-to-move.\nPossession began from 18 January 2024\n, and homes are being handed over on a rolling basis.\n\n**Q: What is the price range at Oberoi Three Sixty West?**\n\nA:\n4 BHK apartments are priced from ₹45 Cr onwards while 5 BHK apartments are available from ₹57.17 Cr onwards\n, with premium-floor and view-facing units crossing ₹99 Cr in resale.\n\n**Q: Is Oberoi Realty a reliable builder?**\n\nA: Yes —\nOberoi Realty has worked on more than 42 successful projects in and around Mumbai\nover three decades and has a strong delivery and quality track record, though some marquee projects (including Three Sixty West itself) have seen multi-year possession delays.\n\n**Q: What is the nearest metro station to Three Sixty West?**\n\nA:\nThe new Metro Aqua Line (Line 3) connects Worli directly to BKC, Dadar, Chhatrapati Shivaji International Airport and both South and North Mumbai.\nThe Worli (Acharya Atre Chowk) station on Line 3 is approximately 1 km from the project.\n\n**Q: Is Three Sixty West a good investment?**\n\nA: For capital preservation and prestige, yes — Worli is supply-constrained, the Ritz-Carlton tag is unique, and\naverage asking price is rising quarter-on-quarter\n. For rental yield (~1.3% gross), no — this is a trophy asset, not a cash-flow play.\n\n**Q: What configurations are available?**\n\nA: Only large-format homes —\nOberoi Three Sixty West offers 4 & 5 BHK flats\nwith carpet areas of 5,235 sq.ft. and 6,651 sq.ft. respectively.\n\n**Q: Are the apartments delivered fully furnished?**\n\nA: No.\nThe builder is providing bareshell apartments\n, meaning buyers need to invest separately in flooring, kitchens, wardrobes, and interior fit-outs after possession.\n\n## Related News\n\n### Questions & Answers (0)\n\n### Terms & Conditions — Q&A\n\nBy submitting a question on RealtyPromoo, you agree to these terms:\n\n#### 1. Content Policy\n\n#### 2. Publication\n\n#### 3. Phone & Email\n\n#### 4. Answer Accuracy\n\n#### 5. Pre-RERA / Pre-Launch Projects\n\n#### 6. Moderation\n\n#### 7. Privacy\n\n#### 8. Jurisdiction\n\nBe the first to ask a question. Get an answer in seconds.\n\n### Questions & Answers\n\nThis page was drafted by **Hukum Singh**, Senior Property Analyst (Freelancer) after an on-site visit, with research support from artificial intelligence. AI assisted in compiling information from public sources, and the final content was reviewed by our editor before publishing. We update listings as new information becomes available.\n\n**Sources consulted:** On-site visit by author · Developer official website · State RERA portal verification · Google Maps location data · YouTube site-visit walkthroughs · Direct broker network.\n\nLast reviewed: 27 April 2026 · [Spot an error? Let us know](/contact)\n\n## EMI Calculator — Oberoi Realty Worli Mumbai Project\n\nEstimate your monthly EMI for this project\n\n### More projects by Oberoi Realty Limited\n\n### More projects in Mumbai\n\n## Related Projects\n\n![Prestige Nautilus](/images/projects/prestige-nautilus-1.webp)\n\n### [Prestige Nautilus](/projects/prestige-nautilus)\n\nby Prestige Group\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n₹40.00 Cr - ₹97.68 Cr\n\n4 BHK, 5 BHK, 6 BHK\n\n![Embassy Worli](/images/projects/embassy-worli-1.webp)\n\n### [Embassy Worli](/projects/embassy-worli)\n\nby Embassy Group\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n₹14.5 Cr - ₹47 Cr+\n\n3 BHK, 4 BHK, 5 BHK, Mansion\n\n![Prestige Jasdon Classic](/images/projects/prestige-jijamata-nagar-worli-1.webp)\n\n### [Prestige Jasdon Classic](/projects/prestige-jijamata-nagar-worli)\n\nby Prestige Group\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n₹1.9 Cr - ₹3.3 Cr (Indicative)\n\n2 BHK, 3 BHK\n\n![Birla Niyaara](/i