Mumbai\n\n₹30.18 Cr - ₹47.49 Cr\n\n4 BHK, 5 BHK\n\n![Runwal Raaya Worli Mumbai](/images/projects/runwal-raaya-worli-mumbai.webp)\n\n### [Runwal Raaya Worli Mumbai](/projects/runwal-raaya-worli-mumbai)\n\nby Runwal Group\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n₹11.05 Cr - ₹33 Cr\n\n3 BHK, 4 BHK, 5 BHK Sky Villas\n\n![Godrej Trilogy Worli Mumbai](/images/projects/godrej-trilogy-worli-mumbai-1.webp)\n\n### [Godrej Trilogy Worli Mumbai](/projects/godrej-trilogy-worli-mumbai)\n\nby Godrej Properties Limited\n\nPhase 1 (Seaturf & Seafront towers) launched Oct 2025 · Phase 2 (Third tower) — RERA pending\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n₹19.97 Cr - ₹31.61 Cr\n\n3 BHK, 4 BHK\n\n![Prestige Jijamata Nagar Worli Mumbai](/images/projects/prestige-jijamata-nagar-worli-mumbai-1.webp)\n\n### [Prestige Jijamata Nagar Worli Mumbai](/projects/prestige-jijamata-nagar-worli-mumbai)\n\nby Prestige Group\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\nPrice on Request\n\n2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK\n\n![Raheja The Riviere Worli Mumbai](/images/projects/raheja-the-riviere-worli-mumbai.webp)\n\n### [Raheja The Riviere Worli Mumbai](/projects/raheja-the-riviere-worli-mumbai)\n\nby Raheja Universal Pvt Ltd\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n₹11.49 Cr - ₹22 Cr\n\n3 BHK, 4 BHK, 5 BHK\n\n![Oberoi Realty Worli Ultra-luxury Project](/images/projects/oberoi-realty-worli-ultra-luxury-project.webp)\n\n### [Oberoi Realty Worli Ultra-luxury Project](/projects/oberoi-realty-worli-ultra-luxury-project)\n\nby Oberoi Realty Limited\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n₹45 Cr - ₹116 Cr+\n\n4 BHK, 5 BHK, Duplex, Penthouse\n\n![Oberoi Realty Bengaluru Upcoming Project](/images/projects/oberoi-realty-bengaluru-upcoming-project-1.webp)\n\n### [Oberoi Realty Bengaluru Upcoming Project](/projects/oberoi-realty-bengaluru-upcoming-project)\n\nby Oberoi Realty Limited\n\nThanisandra, Kogilu, North Bangalore, Bangalore\n\nPrice on Request\n\n2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK\n\n![Oberoi Realty Bandra East RLDA Mumbai Project](/images/projects/oberoi-realty-bandra-east-rlda-mumbai-project.webp)\n\n### [Oberoi Realty Bandra East RLDA Mumbai Project](/projects/oberoi-realty-bandra-east-rlda-mumbai-project)\n\nby Oberoi Realty Limited\n\nBandra East, Mumbai\n\nPrice on Request\n\nMixed-use (Residential + Commercial + Retail — to be announced)\n\n![Oberoi Realty Aman Branded Residences Worli Mumbai Project](/images/projects/oberoi-realty-aman-branded-residences-worli-mumbai-project.webp)\n\n### [Oberoi Realty Aman Branded Residences Worli Mumbai Project](/projects/oberoi-realty-aman-branded-residences-worli-mumbai-project)\n\nby Oberoi Realty Limited\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\nPrice on Request\n\nUltra-luxury branded residences (exact BHK mix TBA)\n\n![Oberoi Forestville by Oberoi Realty](/images/projects/oberoi-forestville-by-oberoi-realty.webp)\n\n### [Oberoi Forestville by Oberoi Realty](/projects/oberoi-forestville-by-oberoi-realty)\n\nby Oberoi Realty Limited\n\nPhase 1 (3 towers) launched Nov 2023, under construction · Phase 2 towers planned over next 5-7 years\n\nKolshet Road, Thane West, Thane\n\n₹1.87 Cr - ₹3.50 Cr\n\n3 BHK, 3 BHK+Studio, 4 BHK, 4.5 BHK, Duplex\n\n![Oberoi Jardin at Oberoi Garden City Thane](/images/projects/oberoi-jardin-at-oberoi-garden-city-thane.webp)\n\n### [Oberoi Jardin at Oberoi Garden City Thane](/projects/oberoi-jardin-at-oberoi-garden-city-thane)\n\nby Oberoi Realty Limited\n\nPhase 1 (2 of 5 towers) launched Oct 2024 and under construction · Remaining 3 towers of Phase 1 yet to launch\n\nPokhran Road No. 2, Thane\n\n₹3.18 Cr - ₹4.33 Cr\n\n3 BHK, 4 BHK\n\n![Oberoi Sky City](/images/projects/oberoi-sky-city.webp)\n\n### [Oberoi Sky City](/projects/oberoi-sky-city)\n\nby Oberoi Realty Limited\n\nTowers A-D & F ready to move (delivered Dec 2023) · Tower E under construction (target Jun 2027) · Tower G under construction (target Dec 2027)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n₹4.25 Cr - ₹13.5 Cr\n\n3 BHK, 4 BHK, 4 BHK Duplex\n\n![Oberoi Elysian](/images/projects/oberoi-elysian.webp)\n\n### [Oberoi Elysian](/projects/oberoi-elysian)\n\nby Oberoi Realty Limited\n\nTower A nearing completion (~70% built) · Tower B under active construction · Towers C, D & E recently RERA-registered and in early construction\n\nMotilal Nagar, Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\n₹5.5 Cr - ₹14 Cr\n\n3 BHK, 4 BHK\n\n![Oberoi Oceanic](/images/projects/oberoi-oceanic.webp)\n\n### [Oberoi Oceanic](/projects/oberoi-oceanic)\n\nby Oberoi Realty Limited\n\nPali Hill, Bandra West, Mumbai\n\n₹8 Cr - ₹28 Cr\n\n2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK, 5 BHK\n\n![Oberoi Peddar Road](/images/projects/oberoi-peddar-road.webp)\n\n### [Oberoi Peddar Road](/projects/oberoi-peddar-road)\n\nby Oberoi Realty Limited\n\nPeddar Road, Mumbai\n\nPrice on Request\n\n3 BHK, 4 BHK (Expected)\n\n![Oberoi Nepean Sea Road](/images/projects/oberoi-nepean-sea-road.webp)\n\n### [Oberoi Nepean Sea Road](/projects/oberoi-nepean-sea-road)\n\nby Oberoi Realty Limited\n\nNepean Sea Road, Mumbai\n\n₹16 Cr - ₹32 Cr (indicative)\n\n3 BHK, 4 BHK, 5 BHK\n\n![Oberoi Versova (Aram Nagar Mhada Redevelopment)](/images/projects/oberoi-versova-aram-nagar-mhada-redevelopment.webp)\n\n### [Oberoi Versova (Aram Nagar Mhada Redevelopment)](/projects/oberoi-versova-aram-nagar-mhada-redevelopment)\n\nby Oberoi Realty Limited\n\nVersova, Andheri West, Mumbai\n\nPrice on Request\n\nTo be announced (likely 2, 3 & 4 BHK based on developer's portfolio)\n\n![Oberoi Alibaug](/images/projects/oberoi-alibaug.webp)\n\n### [Oberoi Alibaug](/projects/oberoi-alibaug)\n\nby Oberoi Realty Limited\n\nTekali, Alibaug\n\nPrice on Request\n\nBranded Villas (BHK mix not officially disclosed; broker chatter cites 3/4/5 BHK)\n\n![Oberoi Pune](/images/projects/oberoi-pune.webp)\n\n### [Oberoi Pune](/projects/oberoi-pune)\n\nby Oberoi Realty Limited\n\nLohegaon, Pune\n\nPrice on Request\n\n2, 3 & 4 BHK (expected, unconfirmed)\n\n![Oberoi Adarsh Nagar (Worli Mhada Redevelopment)](/images/projects/oberoi-adarsh-nagar-worli-mhada-redevelopment.webp)\n\n### [Oberoi Adarsh Nagar (Worli Mhada Redevelopment)](/projects/oberoi-adarsh-nagar-worli-mhada-redevelopment)\n\nby Oberoi Realty Limited\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\nPrice on Request\n\n3 BHK, 4 BHK\n\n![Oberoi Goregaon West](/images/projects/oberoi-goregaon-west.webp)\n\n### [Oberoi Goregaon West](/projects/oberoi-goregaon-west)\n\nby Oberoi Realty Limited\n\nGoregaon West, Mumbai\n\n₹3.5 Cr - ₹6 Cr\n\n2 BHK, 3 BHK\n\n![Oberoi Bandra Reclamation](/images/projects/oberoi-bandra-reclamation.webp)\n\n### [Oberoi Bandra Reclamation](/projects/oberoi-bandra-reclamation)\n\nby Oberoi Realty Limited\n\nBandra East, Mumbai\n\nPrice on Request\n\n3 BHK, 4 BHK, 5 BHK (indicative, per broker channel data)\n\n![Adani Adarsh Nagar Worli Redevelopment](/images/projects/adani-adarsh-nagar-worli-redevelopment.webp)\n\n### [Adani Adarsh Nagar Worli Redevelopment](/projects/adani-adarsh-nagar-worli-redevelopment)\n\nby Adani Realty\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\nPrice on Request\n\nTo Be Announced\n\n![Birla Century Hills](/images/projects/birla-century-hills.webp)\n\n### [Birla Century Hills](/projects/birla-century-hills)\n\nby Birla Estates Private Limited\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\nPrice on Request\n\n2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK (indicative, broker-circulated)\n\n![Bombay Realty Wadia International Center (Wic)](/images/projects/bombay-realty-wadia-international-center-wic.webp)\n\n### [Bombay Realty Wadia International Center (Wic)](/projects/bombay-realty-wadia-international-center-wic)\n\nby Bombay Realty (Bombay Dyeing — Wadia Group)\n\nCommercial towers C1 & C2 operational · Hotel, mall, hospital and residential towers in pre-launch/planning stage\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\nPrice on Request\n\n2 BHK, 3 BHK\n\n![Embassy Citadel](/images/projects/embassy-citadel.webp)\n\n### [Embassy Citadel](/projects/embassy-citadel)\n\nby Embassy Group\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n₹14.5 Cr - ₹31 Cr\n\n3 BHK, 4 BHK, 5 BHK\n\n![Godrej One](/images/projects/godrej-one.webp)\n\n### [Godrej One](/projects/godrej-one)\n\nby Godrej Properties Limited\n\nPhase 1 (Seaturf & Seafront towers) RERA-registered and under construction · Third tower planned for a later phase\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n₹15.8 Cr - ₹31.6 Cr\n\n3 BHK, 4 BHK\n\n![Prestige Residential @ the Prestige Place](/images/projects/prestige-residential-the-prestige-place.webp)\n\n### [Prestige Residential @ the Prestige Place](/projects/prestige-residential-the-prestige-place)\n\nby Prestige Group\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\nPrice on Request (broker channels indicate ₹88 lakh – ₹1.02 Cr, unverified)\n\n2 BHK, 3 BHK (indicative, broker-circulated — final mix unconfirmed)\n\n![Runwal Reserve](/images/projects/runwal-reserve.webp)\n\n### [Runwal Reserve](/projects/runwal-reserve)\n\nby Runwal Group\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n₹11.29 Cr - ₹34.88 Cr\n\n3 BHK, 4 BHK, 5 BHK\n\n![Rustomjee Worli](/images/projects/rustomjee-worli.webp)\n\n### [Rustomjee Worli](/projects/rustomjee-worli)\n\nby Rustomjee Group (Keystone Realtors Limited)\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n₹4 Cr - ₹15 Cr (indicative, unconfirmed)\n\n2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK (indicative, per broker listings)\n\n![K Raheja Artesia](/images/projects/k-raheja-artesia.webp)\n\n### [K Raheja Artesia](/projects/k-raheja-artesia)\n\nby K Raheja Corp Homes (K Raheja Corp Real Estate Private Limited)\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n₹28 Cr - ₹44 Cr\n\n4 BHK\n\n![Lodha Promina](/images/projects/lodha-promina.webp)\n\n### [Lodha Promina](/projects/lodha-promina)\n\nby Lodha Group\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\nPrice on Request\n\nGrade-A Office Spaces: 4,700 sq.ft. to 21,000+ sq.ft. (private offices to full-floor corporate headquarters)\n\n![Lodha Sea Face](/images/projects/lodha-sea-face.webp)\n\n### [Lodha Sea Face](/projects/lodha-sea-face)\n\nby Lodha Group\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n₹90 Cr - ₹190 Cr\n\n5 BHK, 6 BHK\n\n![Lodha Maison](/images/projects/lodha-maison.webp)\n\n### [Lodha Maison](/projects/lodha-maison)\n\nby Lodha Group\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n₹40 Cr - ₹55 Cr\n\n4 BHK Garden Townhouses\n\n![Oberoi Centerstage](/images/projects/oberoi-centerstage.webp)\n\n### [Oberoi Centerstage](/projects/oberoi-centerstage)\n\nby Oberoi Realty Limited\n\nBandra East, Mumbai\n\nPrice on Request\n\nNot yet announced — likely commercial-led mixed-use with residential component\n\n![K Raheja Cg House Worli Redevelopment](/images/projects/k-raheja-cg-house-worli-redevelopment.webp)\n\n### [K Raheja Cg House Worli Redevelopment](/projects/k-raheja-cg-house-worli-redevelopment)\n\nby K Raheja Corp Homes (K Raheja Corp Real Estate Private Limited)\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\nPrice on Request\n\nTBA — likely 3 & 4 BHK (based on K Raheja Corp's existing Worli portfolio)\n\n![Oberoi Tardeo](/images/projects/oberoi-tardeo.webp)\n\n### [Oberoi Tardeo](/projects/oberoi-tardeo)\n\nby Oberoi Realty Limited\n\nTardeo, Mumbai\n\n₹3 Cr - ₹10 Cr\n\n2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK\n\n![Oberoi Sky Heights](/images/projects/oberoi-sky-heights.webp)\n\n### [Oberoi Sky Heights](/projects/oberoi-sky-heights)\n\nby Oberoi Realty Limited\n\nLokhandwala Complex, Mumbai\n\n₹11.08 Cr - ₹22 Cr\n\n4 BHK, 4 BHK Duplex, 5 BHK Duplex/Jodi\n\n![Bombay Realty the Plaza Worli](/images/projects/bombay-realty-the-plaza-worli.webp)\n\n### [Bombay Realty the Plaza Worli](/projects/bombay-realty-the-plaza-worli)\n\nby Bombay Realty (Bombay Dyeing — Wadia Group)\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\nPrice on Request\n\nRetail Stores / High-Street Shops (Customisable Sizes)\n\n![Oberoi BKC (Bandra Kurla Complex)](/images/projects/oberoi-bkc-bandra-kurla-complex.webp)\n\n### [Oberoi BKC (Bandra Kurla Complex)](/projects/oberoi-bkc-bandra-kurla-complex)\n\nby Oberoi Realty Limited\n\nBandra East, Mumbai\n\nPrice on Request\n\nTo Be Announced\n\n![Oberoi Bandra West (Carter Road)](/images/projects/oberoi-bandra-west-carter-road.webp)\n\n### [Oberoi Bandra West (Carter Road)](/projects/oberoi-bandra-west-carter-road)\n\nby Oberoi Realty Limited\n\nPali Hill, Bandra West, Mumbai\n\n₹14 Cr - ₹50 Cr\n\n2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK, 5 BHK\n\n![Oberoi Bandra Bay](/images/projects/oberoi-bandra-bay.webp)\n\n### [Oberoi Bandra Bay](/projects/oberoi-bandra-bay)\n\nby Oberoi Realty Limited\n\nPali Hill, Bandra West, Mumbai\n\nPrice on Request\n\n3 BHK, 4 BHK, 5 BHK (indicative, unconfirmed)\n\n![Birla Century Bhavan](/images/projects/birla-century-bhavan.webp)\n\n### [Birla Century Bhavan](/projects/birla-century-bhavan)\n\nby Birla Estates Private Limited\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\nPrice on Request\n\n3 BHK, 4 BHK, 5 BHK (indicative, based on Birla Estates' Worli portfolio)\n\n![Birla Aurora](/images/projects/birla-aurora.webp)\n\n### [Birla Aurora](/projects/birla-aurora)\n\nby Birla Estates Private Limited\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\nPrice on Request\n\n3 BHK, 4 BHK (expected, based on developer's Worli portfolio)\n\n![Birla Centurion](/images/projects/birla-centurion.webp)\n\n### [Birla Centurion](/projects/birla-centurion)\n\nby Birla Estates Private Limited\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\nPrice on Request\n\n2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK (expected, unconfirmed)\n\n## Ask the Research Desk about Oberoi Realty Worli Mumbai Project\n\nVerified answers from RERA and public records — no spam.\n\n### Popular Cities\n\n### Popular Localities\n\n### Quick Links\n\nRealtyPromoo is a property information portal. We are not a builder, broker, or developer, and do not sell or rent properties. All project information including prices, configurations, RERA numbers and possession dates is sourced from public records and developer-provided data. Verify all details with the developer before any transaction.\n\n© 2026 RealtyPromoo™. All rights reserved.","images":[]},{"url":"https://divyahousingagency.com/property/three-sixty-west","title":"Three Sixty West 4 BHK in Versova, Worli","raw_content":"![Divya Housing Agency — Property Consultants Malad West Mumbai](https://divyahousingagency.com/wp-content/themes/divya-housing-premium/assets/images/logo.webp)\n![Divya Housing Agency](https://divyahousingagency.com/wp-content/themes/divya-housing-premium/assets/images/logo.webp)\n![Three Sixty West — Photo 1](https://divyahousingagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Three-Sixty-West.jpg)\n![Three Sixty West photo 1](https://divyahousingagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Three-Sixty-West.jpg)\n![Three Sixty West photo 2](https://divyahousingagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Three-sixty-west-Worli-Homes.webp)\n![Three Sixty West photo 3](https://divyahousingagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/oberoi-three-xirty-west-tower-A.webp)\n![Three Sixty West photo 4](https://divyahousingagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/oberoi-three-sixty-west-homes-for-sale.webp)\n![]()\n\n# Three Sixty West 4 BHK 5400 SqFt Flat in Versova, Worli\n\n[Versova, Worli](https://divyahousingagency.com/area/worli/)  — Three Sixty West, Dr Annie Besant Road, next to Old Passport Office, Worli, Mumbai 400018\n\n## Project Information\n\n## Three Sixty West\n\n#### 4BHK | 5BHK | Residential Apartment | In Worli | On Sale |\n\nThree Sixty West Offering Exclusive Range of 4 BHK / 5 BHK & Duplex Apartment on Sale in Worli, a Premium Location in South Mumbai. At the **Three Sixty West**, India’s Premier Residences and the World’s Most Exclusive Hotel offer a new perspective on perfection. It is an expression of a world-class vision — to create an iconic identifier for one of the world’s great cities; and to provide homes of distinction for India’s most accomplished families. Three Sixty West is a mixed-use development located in Worli, Mumbai, and comprises two towers. One will house The **Ritz-Carlton Hotel** and the other will have **luxury residences managed by Three Sixty Towe Ritz-Carlton**. **Three Sixty West** Mumbai Andheri-Dahisar is a RERA-registered project with registration number **P51900012115**.\n\nThe development is a true marvel of design; the towers are carefully angled so that each home benefits from stunning sea views while impeccable planning ensures that Residents enjoy utmost discretion and privacy. An unparalleled range of lifestyle experiences is made available through Club 360. Spread across two levels, it has contrasting zones for sports, fitness, kids’ activities, and adventure at one end and leisure, lounging, and relaxation at the other.\n\nThe **Ritz-Carlton, Mumbai** will have about 220 rooms, fine dining restaurants, a sea view bar, a spa an expansive banquet, and other exclusive facilities all of which can be availed by the residents of **Three Sixty West** for themselves or their guests and relatives. **Three Sixty West** is strategically located at **Worli** which is one of the most premium and upscale locations in Mumbai flanked by the shimmering Arabian Sea. Over time, **Three Sixty West** is set to become the iconic identifier for Mumbai’s skyline.\n\n**Tower A** is designated to be a hotel. Private residences will be located in **Tower B**. But the star attraction lies in the podium which is situated in between. It will accommodate restaurants and ballrooms.\n\n#### Available\n\n##### 4BHK | Residential Apartment | Flat In Worli | On Sale |\n\n##### 5BHK | Residential Apartment | Flat In Worli | On Sale |\n\n#### Amenities\n\n## Amenities & Features\n\n## Location & Nearby Connectivity\n\n## About Worli\n\nWorli is a well-connected western suburb location with residential options across ready, resale and new-launch properties. Buyers usually compare projects here by carpet area, possession stage, connectivity, amenities and budget.For current availability in this neighbourhood, speak with Divya Housing Agency and compare verified options before booking a visit.\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions — Three Sixty West\n\nVisible feedback shown for trust; no self-serving review schema is generated.\n\nFound our 2 BHK in Malad West within our budget in just 3 site visits. The team knew exactly which pockets to show us.\n\nOne call to Divya Housing and we had 4 genuine options the same week. No time wasting, no fake listings. Closed in 3 weeks.\n\nTransparent brokerage no surprises at the end. Handled all paperwork and legal verification.\n\n## Similar Properties You May Like\n\n![Lodha Kiara Worli — 2 BHK in Worli](https://divyahousingagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Lodha-Kiara-.jpe)\n\n## [Lodha Kiara Worli](https://divyahousingagency.com/project/lodha-kiara-worli-worli/)\n\n![Sugee Marina Bay — 3 BHK in Worli](https://divyahousingagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Sugee-Marina-Bay-1.jpe)\n\n## [Sugee Marina Bay](https://divyahousingagency.com/project/sugee-marina-bay-worli/)\n\n![Runwal Auris — 3 BHK, 4 BHK in Malad West](https://divyahousingagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/runwal-auris-640x360.webp)\n\n## [Runwal Auris](https://divyahousingagency.com/project/runwal-auris/) by Runwal Realty\n\n4 BHK | Carpet 5400 SqFt\n\n### Get Property Details\n\nWe will confirm the exact appointment after checking current access and availability.\n\n![Divya Housing Agency](https://divyahousingagency.com/wp-content/themes/divya-housing-premium/assets/images/logo.webp)\n\nTrusted RERA-registered real estate consultants in Malad West, Mumbai. Specialising in residential and commercial properties across Mumbai's western suburbs since 2004.\n\n### Buy a Flat\n\n### Browse by Location\n\n### About Us\n\n© 2026 Divya Housing Agency. All rights reserved.\n\nWe will confirm the exact appointment after checking current access and availability.\n\nWe will confirm the exact appointment after checking current access and availability.\n\n## WhatsApp Enquiry\n\nShare your details and continue to WhatsApp.","images":[]},{"url":"https://blox.xyz/projects/oberoi-three-sixty-west","title":"Oberoi Three Sixty West Worli Mumbai | ₹12 Cr onwards | Sea View","raw_content":"![Blox Logo](/assets/images/blox-logo-white.svg)\n![user-primary](/assets/icons/user-primary.svg)\n![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n![share-primary](/assets/icons/share-primary.svg)\n![compare-inactive-secondary](/assets/icons/compare-inactive-secondary.svg)\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/oberoi-realty-oberoi-three-sixty-west-elevation-1678718154.webp)\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/oberoi-realty-oberoi-three-sixty-west-bedroom-1704447348.webp)\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/oberoi-realty-oberoi-three-sixty-west-bedroom-1704447358.webp)\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/oberoi-realty-oberoi-three-sixty-west-bedroom-1704447367.webp)\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/oberoi-realty-oberoi-three-sixty-west-elevation-1746518390.jpg)\n![Propert-Icon](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/171121062244-Oberoi_Realty.png)\n\n# Oberoi Three Sixty West\n\n![video-primary](/assets/icons/video-primary.svg)\n![call-rm](/assets/icons/call-rm.svg)\n![calendar-primary](/assets/icons/calendar-primary.svg)\n\n## Overview\n\n## Google AI Summary\n\n![up-thumb](/assets/icons/up-thumb.svg)\n\n### The good things\n\n![down-thumb](/assets/icons/down-thumb.svg)\n\n### Needs improvement\n\n## Amenities\n\n![amenities/Car-Parking-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Car-Parking-secondary.svg)\n![amenities/gym-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-secondary.svg)\n![amenities/indoor-games-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/indoor-games-secondary.svg)\n![amenities/jogging-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-secondary.svg)\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary.svg)\n![amenities/large-green-area-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/large-green-area-secondary.svg)\n![amenities/large-green-area-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/large-green-area-secondary.svg)\n![amenities/Multi-purpose-court-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Multi-purpose-court-secondary.svg)\n![amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-secondary.svg)\n![amenities/swimming-pool-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/swimming-pool-secondary.svg)\n![amenities/walking-area-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/walking-area-secondary.svg)\n![amenities/Lobby-1-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Lobby-1-secondary.svg)\n![arrow-down-grey](/assets/icons/arrow-down-grey.svg)\n![amenities/Car-Parking-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/Car-Parking-primary.svg)\n![amenities/gym-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-primary.svg)\n![amenities/indoor-games-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/indoor-games-primary.svg)\n![amenities/jogging-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-primary.svg)\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-primary.svg)\n![amenities/large-green-area-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/large-green-area-primary.svg)\n![amenities/large-green-area-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/large-green-area-primary.svg)\n![amenities/Multi-purpose-court-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/Multi-purpose-court-primary.svg)\n![amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-primary.svg)\n![amenities/swimming-pool-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/swimming-pool-primary.svg)\n![amenities/walking-area-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/walking-area-primary.svg)\n![amenities/Lobby-1-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/Lobby-1-primary.svg)\n![arrow-next-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-next-primary.svg)\n\n## Price & Floor Plan\n\n## \n\n## 5235 sq. ft\n\n![Floor_Plan_Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/properties/oberoi-realty-oberoi-three-sixty-west-4-bhk-bedroom-1704447520.webp)\n\n## Locality\n\n![school-primary](/assets/icons/school-primary.svg)\n![bank-secondary](/assets/icons/bank-secondary.svg)\n![hospital-secondary](/assets/icons/hospital-secondary.svg)![pdp-school](/assets/icons/pdp-school.svg)![pdp-school](/assets/icons/pdp-school.svg)![pdp-school](/assets/icons/pdp-school.svg)![pdp-school](/assets/icons/pdp-school.svg)![pdp-school](/assets/icons/pdp-school.svg)![pdp-school](/assets/icons/pdp-school.svg)\n\n### Home Loan Calculator\n\nStarting from ₹47,02,393 per month\n\nExplore the cost of your home by adjusting the details\n\nTotal amount : ₹56,42,87,209\n\n## Enquire Now\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n![user-primary](/assets/icons/user-primary.svg)\n![smartphone-primary](/assets/icons/smartphone-primary.svg)\n![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\n## RERA QR Codes\n\nOberoi Three Sixty West is a real estate project registered under MahaRERA (Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority), ensuring transparency and accountability in its development.\n\nScan this RERA QR code to find out more or search ID here - <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in>\n\n![]()\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n### When is the possession date for Oberoi Three Sixty West?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\n### What is the RERA carpet area range of Oberoi Three Sixty West?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\n### What is the price range of Oberoi Three Sixty West?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\n### Where is Oberoi Three Sixty West located?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\n### What configurations are available in Oberoi Three Sixty West?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\n### What is the status of Oberoi Three Sixty West?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\n### Which amenities are provided in Oberoi Three Sixty West?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\n### Who is the developer of Oberoi Three Sixty West?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\n## About The Developer\n\n![Developer for Oberoi Three Sixty West:Oberoi Realty](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/171121062244-Oberoi_Realty.png)\n\n## Oberoi Realty\n\n## Properties In The Same Area\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/godrej-properties-godrej-trilogy-seaturf-elevation-1763361218.jpg)\n![Godrej Trilogy Seaturf](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/171121063331-ADI_GODREJ.png)\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/prestige-group-prestige-nautilus-kitchen-1749206628.jpg)\n![Prestige Nautilus](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/250522071013-prestigegroup.png)\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/runwal-developers-runwal-raaya-elevation-1755084640.jpg)\n![Runwal Raaya](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/241024024654-runwal-logo-1.webp)\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/akshay-sthapatya-hsa-akshay-47-race-course-elevation-1714980221.webp)\n![Akshay 47 Race Course](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/200523072155-newproject-16.webp)\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n![arrow-left-swiper](/assets/icons/arrow-left-swiper.svg)\n![arrow-right-swiper](/assets/icons/arrow-right-swiper.svg)\n\n## Similar Projects\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/prestige-group-prestige-nautilus-kitchen-1749206628.jpg)\n![Prestige Nautilus](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/250522071013-prestigegroup.png)\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n![arrow-left-swiper](/assets/icons/arrow-left-swiper.svg)\n![arrow-right-swiper](/assets/icons/arrow-right-swiper.svg)\n\n## Properties for sale in Mumbai\n\n## Developers in Worli , Mumbai\n\n## Property by configuration in Worli, Mumbai\n\n## Property by budget in Worli, Mumbai\n\n## Projects by construction status in Worli, Mumbai\n\n![Blox Logo](/assets/images/blox-logo-white.svg)\n\n### OVERVIEW\n\n### EXPLORE\n\nReferral\n\n### CITIES WE SERVE\n\n### FOLLOW US\n\n![facebook-primary](/assets/icons/facebook-primary.svg)\n![instagram-primary](/assets/icons/instagram-primary.svg)\n![linkedin-primary](/assets/icons/linkedin-primary.svg)\n![twitter-x-primary](/assets/icons/twitter-x-primary.svg)\n![youtube-primary](/assets/icons/youtube-primary.svg)\n![mail-primary](/assets/icons/mail-primary.svg)\n\n© Copyright 2026 Blox.xyz","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/oberoi-three-sixty-west/64854/project","title":"Oberoi Three Sixty West Worli, Mumbai | Price List, Floor Plan, Reviews & RERA Details","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![Oberoi Realty developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/oberoi-realty-589.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# Oberoi Three Sixty West Worli, Mumbai\n\nOberoi Three Sixty West is a Ready to Move luxury residential project by Oberoi Realty in Worli, Mumbai, with possession available since Mar 2019. Oberoi Three Sixty West offers 4, 5 BHK ranging from 5235 Sq.Ft. to 6651 Sq.Ft., spread across 1.58 Acres with 284 units, priced from ₹ 45.00 Cr to ₹ 57.17 Cr. The project is RERA registered, giving buyers regulatory clarity on a completed, ready-to-move tower. Oberoi Three Sixty West's pitch rests on its Worli address along the Mumbai coastline, close to Eastern Express Highway, Dr Annie Besant Road and within reach of Prabhadevi Municipal Primary School, Prabhadevi, Phoenix Palladium, Worli, Siddhivinayak Temple, Dahisar East, Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj Park, Shivaji Park. Oberoi Realty brings a multi-decade luxury development track record to the table, and Worli's average asking price of ₹ 74,050 /Sq.Ft. per sq. ft gives buyers a clear benchmark against Oberoi Three Sixty West's current rate. The project suits end users and investors seeking a large-format, move-in-ready home in South Mumbai's established luxury corridor rather than a project still tied to a construction timeline.\n\n![Oberoi Three Sixty West Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/oberoi-three-sixty-west-project-project-large-image1-9070.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![Oberoi Three Sixty West Apartment Interiors](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/oberoi-three-sixty-west-project-apartment-interiors1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Oberoi Three Sixty West Apartment Interiors](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/oberoi-three-sixty-west-project-apartment-interiors5.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Oberoi Three Sixty West Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-oberoi-three-sixty-west-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹45.00 Cr - 57.17 Cr**\n\n₹89,200 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## About Oberoi Three Sixty West, Worli by Oberoi Realty\n\nBeyond the pitch, here's the full spec sheet for Oberoi Three Sixty West in one place: developer, possession status, RERA registration, land parcel, unit count, configurations, and price range. Every field below is pulled directly from the RERA filing and the live listing, so each one can be checked independently.\n\n| **Parameter** | **Details** |\n| --- | --- |\n| Project Name | Oberoi Three Sixty West |\n| Developer | Oberoi Realty |\n| Location | Worli, Mumbai |\n| Status | Ready to Move |\n| Launch Date | Sep 2017 |\n| Possession | Mar 2019 |\n| RERA Number | P51900012115 |\n| Total Area | 1.58 Acres |\n| Total Units | 284 |\n| Configurations | 4, 5 BHK |\n| Size Range | 5235 Sq.Ft. to 6651 Sq.Ft. |\n| Price Range | ₹ 45.00 Cr to ₹ 57.17 Cr |\n| Connecting Roads | Eastern Express Highway, Dr Annie Besant Road |\n\n### What makes Oberoi Three Sixty West different from other projects?\n\n## Oberoi Three Sixty West Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Oberoi Three Sixty West.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 BHK Apartment  5235 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 45.00 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 5 BHK Apartment  6651 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 57.17 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nOberoi Three Sixty West's average asking price is rising quarter-on-quarter, compared with Worli.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Oberoi Three Sixty West | Worli |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 92750 | 66300 |\n| Mar 2026 | 91800 | 74050 |\n| Dec 2025 | 90050 | 70800 |\n| Sep 2025 | 97700 | 65700 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nOberoi Three Sixty West avg. price is ₹ 92.8 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Worli at ₹ 66.3 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| Current Project **Oberoi Three Sixty West** | ₹ 92,750 |\n| [Embassy Citadel](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/embassy-citadel/342673/project \"Embassy Citadel\") | ₹ 73,700 |\n| [Kalpataru One](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-one/246980/project \"Kalpataru One\") | ₹ 69,050 |\n| Worli | ₹ 66,300 |\n| [K Raheja Artesia](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/k-raheja-artesia/13648/project \"K Raheja Artesia\") | ₹ 59,550 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Worli ranges from ₹ 34.9 K to ₹ 9.6 L with options available for STUDIO,1,2,3,4,5,6 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Oberoi Three Sixty West | In Worli |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 70 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 1.9 L |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 3.8 L |\n| 4 BHK | - | ₹ 5.2 L |\n| 5 BHK | - | ₹ 8.7 L |\n| 6 BHK | - | ₹ 9.6 L |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Oberoi Three Sixty West.\n\nA total of 8 residential transactions has been registered so far for Oberoi Three Sixty West, amounting to ₹ 776 Cr till September 2026.\n\n#### 27 Underground Parking Facilities to Combat Mumbai's Parking Crisis\n\nMumbai is set to develop 27 underground parking facilities, one in each administrative ward, to alleviate the severe parking shortage. This project, backed by the BMC Budget 2026-27, will create parking beneath existing gardens and playgrounds, reducing roadside parking and traffic congestion.\n\n#### New Road Link Approved to Enhance Mumbai Connectivity\n\nThe Maharashtra government has approved a ₹1,722 crore road link project aimed at connecting the Versova-Bandra Sea Link with the Mumbai Coastal Road. This infrastructure development is expected to significantly improve traffic flow, reduce commuting times across the city.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Oberoi Three Sixty West moved from ₹ 91,800/sqft to ₹ 92,750/sqft, reflecting a 1.03% rise.\n\n#### Mumbai to Establish Four New Helipads for Emergency Services\n\nMumbai authorities are planning to construct four new helipads within the next six years to enhance emergency response capabilities. Two helipads will be built along the Coastal Road, one at Worli and another in Kandivali's Charkop area. The remaining two will be developed in the Bandra Kurla Complex (BKC).\n\n#### Elphinstone Road Overbridge Dismantled for Infrastructure Upgrade\n\nMumbai's historic Elphinstone Road Overbridge, a 113-year-old British-era structure, has been dismantled. This move is part of infrastructure upgrades aimed at improving rail operations and commuter safety. The dismantling creates space for two additional suburban lines between Kurla and Parel, which will eventually extend to CSMT. A new double-decker ROB will replace the old structure.\n\n#### Versova Property Market Poised for Growth Driven by Sea Link and Redevelopment\n\nThe Versova property market is experiencing a surge in demand and property prices, fueled by the upcoming Versova-Bandra Sea Link and ongoing redevelopment projects. This infrastructure development is expected to sustain property values and attract significant buyer interest in the coming years.\n\nDuring Q1'2026, average property prices for Oberoi Three Sixty West moved from ₹ 90,050/sqft to ₹ 91,800/sqft, reflecting a 1.94% rise.\n\n#### Mumbai Infrastructure Projects Gain Momentum with Budget Allocations and Project Launches\n\nMumbai is experiencing a surge in infrastructure and activity. The BMC has proposed a record budget of ₹80,952.56 crore for FY 2026-27, with a significant portion allocated to infrastructure projects like the Coastal Road, Goregaon-Mulund Link Road (GMLR), and Sewage Treatment Plants (STPs).MMRDA has allocated over ₹5,400 crore for road tunnel projects, including one connecting Worli-Bandra Sea Link to Mumbai Airport.\n\n#### BMC Outlines Timelines for Key Infrastructure Projects\n\nThe BMC has set completion targets for key infrastructure projects: the Bandra (E)-Kalanagar skywalk (almost complete) , the first phase of the Bandra-Dharavi flyover reconstruction (Mithi river widening project ,near completion) , and the Worli connector by December 2026. These projects are expected to improve pedestrian access, ease traffic congestion, and enhance overall connectivity within the city.\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n8 Sales Transactions Registered in Oberoi Three Sixty West From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 68.2 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 8 | ₹ 776 Cr | ₹ 68,200 / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Oct 25 to Sep 26\n\n## Oberoi Three Sixty West Floor Plans\n\nOberoi Three Sixty West's floor plans cover two configurations, 4 BHK and 5 BHK, both large-format layouts built for premium urban living. Every apartment shares vitrified tile flooring, acrylic emulsion walls, premium bath fittings, and an RCC frame structure. Since the tower is Ready to Move, these aren't projected sizes, they reflect the completed, deliverable product.\n\n### Oberoi Three Sixty West Configuration and Pricing\n\nHere's how the two available configurations compare on carpet area and price, so you can weigh the step-up from the 4 BHK to the 5 BHK before shortlisting a unit.\n\n| **Configuration** | **Carpet Area** | **Price** |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 BHK Apartment | 5235 Sq. Ft. | ₹ 45.00 Cr |\n| 5 BHK Apartment | 6651 Sq. Ft. | ₹ 57.17 Cr |\n\n### Which Oberoi Three Sixty West unit suits an end user upgrading within South Mumbai?\n\nThe 4 BHK Apartment at 5235 Sq. Ft. for ₹ 45.00 Cr is the entry configuration at Oberoi Three Sixty West. For a buyer moving up from a smaller South Mumbai home, this size still delivers the tower's full amenity access and sea-facing address, without stepping up to the largest unit on offer.\n\n### Which Oberoi Three Sixty West unit suits a buyer who wants the largest home in the tower?\n\nThe 5 BHK Apartment at 6651 Sq. Ft. for ₹ 57.17 Cr is the flagship configuration, built for a buyer who wants the most space the development offers rather than the most efficient price per square foot. Recent registered transactions show units in this size range trading well above ₹9,000 sq. ft. of built floor.\n\n### Is Oberoi Three Sixty West a good investment given limited resale inventory?\n\nWith only 284 units across the entire development and roughly a quarter booked as of the last recorded update, resale inventory at Oberoi Three Sixty West stays genuinely limited. Nine transactions worth ₹990 Cr registered in the past year point to real, ongoing demand rather than a stalled resale market, though buyers should weigh the registered transaction rate against the higher current asking-price trend before making an offer.\n\n### What to verify before booking at Oberoi Three Sixty West?\n\n![Floor plan of 4 BHK 5235 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Oberoi Three Sixty West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/oberoi-three-sixty-west-apartment-4-bhk-5235sqft-20240229180240.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 45.00 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 5 BHK 6651 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Oberoi Three Sixty West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/oberoi-three-sixty-west-apartment-5-bhk-6651sqft-20240329180318.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 57.17 Cr\n\n## Resale & Rental Listings in Oberoi Three Sixty West\n\nExplore resale and rental listings currently available in Oberoi Three Sixty West, Mumbai.\n\n![4 BHK + Servant Room,Extra Room Apartment For Sale in Oberoi Three Sixty West in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![kiran amin  profile picture]()\n![4 BHK Penthouse For Sale in Oberoi Three Sixty West in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![5 BHK Apartment For Sale in Oberoi Three Sixty West in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![5 BHK Apartment For Sale in Oberoi Three Sixty West in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![Riya Realty  profile picture]()\n![5 BHK Apartment For Sale in Oberoi Three Sixty West in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![5 BHK Apartment For Sale in Oberoi Three Sixty West in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![5 BHK Apartment For Sale in Oberoi Three Sixty West in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![6 BHK Penthouse For Sale in Oberoi Three Sixty West in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![6+ BHK + Pooja Room,Servant Room,Study Room,Extra Room,Basement Penthouse For Sale in Oberoi Three Sixty West in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![4 BHK Apartment For Rent in Oberoi Three Sixty West in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![Riya Realty  profile picture]()\n![4 BHK Apartment For Rent in Oberoi Three Sixty West in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![Riya Realty  profile picture]()\n![4 BHK Apartment For Rent in Oberoi Three Sixty West in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![Riya Realty  profile picture]()\n![5 BHK Apartment For Rent in Oberoi Three Sixty West in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![Riya Realty  profile picture]()\n![5 BHK Apartment For Rent in Oberoi Three Sixty West in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![Riya Realty  profile picture]()\n![5 BHK Apartment For Rent in Oberoi Three Sixty West in Worli, Mumbai]()\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![Riya Realty  profile picture]()\n![Riya Realty]()\n\nMumbai\n\nMumbai\n\n![Kiran Amin]()\n\nKiran Amin\n\nMumbai\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of Oberoi Three Sixty West\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and walkthrough videos of Oberoi Three Sixty West to understand the overall layout, tower placement, amenities, landscaped spaces and key highlights before making your buying decision.\n\n![Oberoi Three Sixty West Apartment Interiors](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/oberoi-three-sixty-west-project-apartment-interiors1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Oberoi Three Sixty West Apartment Interiors](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/oberoi-three-sixty-west-project-apartment-interiors5.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Oberoi Three Sixty West Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-oberoi-three-sixty-west-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\nDownload master plan of Oberoi Three Sixty West to explore layout details in Worli, Mumbai.\n\n### Master Plan\n\nOverall project layout & design\n\n### Walkthrough Video\n\nVirtual tour of the property\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of Oberoi Three Sixty West\n\nOberoi Three Sixty West's amenities run considerably broader than most towers at this price point, spanning sports, convenience, safety, leisure, and environment categories with 28 named facilities in total. Buyer reviews consistently call out the sports lineup and the clubhouse as standout features of daily life here.\n\n### Sports and Fitness\n\nThese cover both competitive and casual formats across indoor and outdoor spaces, a genuinely broad lineup that several resident reviews specifically highlight as a project strength.\n\n| **Amenity** | **Category** |\n| --- | --- |\n| Gymnasium | Fitness |\n| Swimming Pool | Aquatics |\n| Kids' Pool | Aquatics |\n| Badminton Court(s) | Racquet Sports |\n| Tennis Court(s) | Racquet Sports |\n| Squash Court | Racquet Sports |\n| Basketball | Court Sports |\n| Table Tennis | Indoor Sport |\n| Jogging / Cycle Track | Wellness |\n| Yoga Areas | Wellness |\n| Kids' Play Areas / Sand Pits | Family |\n\n### Convenience and Leisure\n\nBeyond sport, these amenities cover daily utilities and the social spaces residents use for downtime, including a business lounge and restaurant referenced in the project's own USP list.\n\n| **Amenity** | **Category** |\n| --- | --- |\n| Power Backup | Utilities |\n| Treated Water Supply | Utilities |\n| 24\\*7 Water Supply | Utilities |\n| Lift | Building Infrastructure |\n| Pet Area | Convenience |\n| Party Lawn | Leisure |\n| Cafe / Coffee Bar | Leisure |\n| Party Hall | Leisure |\n| Clubhouse | Leisure |\n| Indoor Games | Leisure |\n\n### Safety and Environment\n\nSecurity and sustainability infrastructure round out the list, standard essentials that matter more at scale in a 284-unit, two-tower development.\n\n| **Amenity** | **Category** |\n| --- | --- |\n| 24 x 7 Security | Safety |\n| CCTV / Video Surveillance | Safety |\n| Fire Fighting Systems | Safety |\n| Intercom Facility | Safety |\n| Rain Water Harvesting | Environment |\n| Sewage Treatment Plant | Environment |\n| Normal Park / Central Green | Environment |\n\n**Key Takeaway:** Buyer reviews specifically praise the pet area, the gym, and the overall greenery on the premises, a useful cross-check against the formal amenity list above before booking.\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-gymnasiu-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Leisure Leisure\n\n![Leisure](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/leisure/am-ico-cafecoff-active.svg)\n\n### Environment Environment\n\n![Environment](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/environment/am-ico-rainwate-active.svg)\n\n### Specifications\n\n## Location and Connectivity Around Oberoi Realty Worli\n\nOberoi Three Sixty West sits in Worli, within Mumbai's Mumbai South belt, along the Mumbai coastline. Worli's average asking price runs at ₹ 74,050 /Sq.Ft. per sq. ft, a useful reference against Oberoi Three Sixty West's own current rate. The locality is one of the most established luxury residential corridors in the city, known for the Bandra-Worli Sea Link and its proximity to Lower Parel, Nariman Point, and Bandra.\n\n### Connectivity\n\nEastern Express Highway, Dr Annie Besant Road anchor Oberoi Three Sixty West's access to the rest of Mumbai, with the Bandra-Worli Sea Link cutting travel time to the western suburbs considerably.\n\n| **Landmark** | **Distance** |\n| --- | --- |\n| Dr Annie Besant Road | 0.2 km |\n| Eastern Express Highway | 2 km |\n\n### Nearby Landmarks with Confirmed Distance\n\nThese are the landmarks the project page lists with an exact distance figure, covering the categories that matter most for daily life: education, transit, and healthcare.\n\n| **Landmark** | **Distance** |\n| --- | --- |\n| Medifit Medical Academy Mumbai | 0.2 km |\n| Worli Hospital For Women | 0.2 km |\n| Gammon House (Bus Stop) | 0.5 km |\n\nBeyond these measured distances, Prabhadevi Municipal Primary School, Prabhadevi, Phoenix Palladium, Worli, Siddhivinayak Temple, Dahisar East, Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj Park, Shivaji Park add further context, including Prabhadevi Municipal Primary School and Dy Patil International School, giving families more than one nearby schooling option even without an exact distance on record. One resident review also notes the nearest railway station sits about 0.4 km away and the international airport roughly 20 km out.\n\n### Is Oberoi Three Sixty West a practical daily address?\n\nIt largely is, for both families and professionals. A school and a hospital both sit just 0.2 km away, and Eastern Express Highway, Dr Annie Besant Road keep the wider city reachable, with the Sea Link cutting the commute to the western suburbs. Worli's own locality snapshot notes good accessibility across transport modes as a strength, though it also flags traffic congestion during peak hours as a genuine daily concern for commuters in the area.\n\n**Location Insight:** Worli's locality average of ₹ 74,050 /Sq.Ft. per sq. ft sits well below Oberoi Three Sixty West's own asking-price trend, reflecting the premium buyers pay for a completed, sea-adjacent luxury tower over the broader Worli market.\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around Mumbai South](/assets/images/project-map.png?aio=w-714;h-317;crop;)\n\nEstimate commute from your office or kid's school to Oberoi Three Sixty West.\n\n![Car travel mode](/assets/images/car-fill.svg)\n![Oberoi Three Sixty West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/oberoi-three-sixty-west-project-project-large-image1-9070.jpg?aio=w-112;h-96;crop;)\n\nPlease select the starting point to calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### Medifit Medical Academy Mumbai Ho Medifit Biologicals Limited\n\n#### Gammon House\n\n#### Worli Hospital For Women\n\n### Connecting Roads\n\nAverage Asking Price in Worli\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\nThe locality has good accessibility to many modes of transport like bus, train, auto, cab, etc.\n\nTraffic congestion during peak hours is a cause of concern for daily commuters\n\nNice\n\n— Vishal Roy, Real estate agent\n\n## RERA Details of Oberoi Three Sixty West\n\nOberoi Three Sixty West is registered with Maharashtra RERA under P51900012115, with possession available since Mar 2019. The project is currently Ready to Move, developed by Oberoi Realty across 284 units on 1.58 Acres.\n\n### RERA Parameters\n\nEvery field below is drawn directly from the project's RERA filing, so it can be independently verified on the state portal. Registration number, possession status, unit count, and land parcel all sit on public record, giving buyers a documented reference point beyond the developer's own marketing material.\n\n| **RERA Parameter** | **Details** |\n| --- | --- |\n| RERA Number | P51900012115 |\n| Regulatory Authority | Maharashtra RERA (MahaRERA) |\n| Registered Developer | Oberoi Realty |\n| Launch Date | Sep 2017 |\n| Possession | Mar 2019 |\n| Status | Ready to Move |\n| Total Units | 284 |\n| Site Area (RERA Filing) | 1.58 Acres |\n| Square Yards RERA Registration | A51800000454 |\n| Verification Portal | maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in |\n\n### Key buyer protections\n\n### Stamp Duty and Registration in Mumbai\n\nThese are the standard state-mandated charges to budget for on top of Oberoi Three Sixty West's quoted price. Since this is a completed, ready-to-move purchase, these charges typically apply at the time of registration rather than being staggered across a construction-linked payment plan.\n\n| **Charge** | **Rate** |\n| --- | --- |\n| Stamp Duty (Male Ownership) | 6% |\n| Stamp Duty (Female Ownership) | 5% |\n| Stamp Duty (Joint Ownership) | 5.5% |\n| Registration Charges | 1% of transaction value |\n\n## Property Registration Data\n\n8 Sales Transactions Registered in Oberoi Three Sixty West From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 68.2 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Registry Date | Floor/Unit | Tower/Wing | Area | Transaction Value | Rate/Sq. Ft. | Actions |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2026-03-25 | Floor 21, Unit 2103 | B | 2,974 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2026-03-24 | Floor 39, 40, Unit 5503 | B | 9,308 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2026-01-29 | Floor 27, Unit 2703 | B | 5,395 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2025-12-22 | Floor 56, Unit 56 | A | 11,326 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2025-12-15 | Floor 44, Unit 4401 | B | 6,838 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2025-10-18 | Floor 35, Unit 35 | A | 14,911 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2025-10-16 | Floor 51, Unit 5102 | B | 6,130 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2025-10-16 | Floor 52, Unit 5202 | B | 6,130 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2025-09-23 | Floor 45, Unit 45 | A | 14,911 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2025-09-05 | Floor 52, Unit 52 | A | 14,911 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n\n## How does Oberoi Three Sixty West compare with similar projects?\n\n![Oberoi Three Sixty West project in Worli, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-oberoi-three-sixty-west-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Oberoi Three Sixty West](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/oberoi-three-sixty-west/64854/project \"Oberoi Three Sixty West\")\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![K Raheja Artesia project in Worli, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-k-raheja-artesia-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [K Raheja Artesia](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/k-raheja-artesia/13648/project \"K Raheja Artesia\")\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n![Indiabulls Blu Tower A project in Worli, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-indiabulls-blu-tower-a-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Indiabulls Blu Tower A](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/indiabulls-blu-tower-a/100709/project \"Indiabulls Blu Tower A\")\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\nSend one enquiry to all selected projects and compare up to 4 options side-by-side.\n\n## Oberoi Three Sixty West Reviews & Ratings\n\nRead the reviews about Oberoi Three Sixty West located at Worli Mumbai and see what residents and real estate experts have to say about the project.\n\nOwner\n\nMumbai South is home to the opulent residential development Oberoi Three Sixty West. The project offers a beautiful, green environment. The homes range in size from 4 to 5 bedrooms and are furnished with all the conveniences one might want in a contemporary dwelling. The project is a great area to reside in because it close to educational institutions and leisure venues. All of the city significant landmarks are easily accessible from our apartment as well.\n\nOwner\n\nI wanted my Mumbai apartment to be enormous when I was making my plans to buy one. This Mumbai house will be our first. The Oberoi Three Sixty West is a high-end development that provides a selection of homes ideal for individuals seeking an opulent way of life. It also fits within our budget. There are apartments available that are 4 BHK-5 BHK and have remarkable sizes ranging from 5000 sq. ft to 6550 sq. ft.\n\nOwner\n\nOberoi Three Sixty West is thoughtfully located in Mumbai. Situated in Mumbai South, Oberoi Three Sixty West is about 0.2 miles away from Dr. Annie Besant Road. This placement guarantees that visitors from different sections of the city can get to this spot with ease. Additionally, the residence is near well-known tourist destinations and shopping centers. The residence is located around 20 km from the international airport and 0.4 km from the closest train station.\n\nOwner\n\nI'm delighted to have possession at last. Two towers make up the mixed-use property Three Sixty West, which is situated in Worli. The Ritz-Carlton Hotel will be located in one, and the Ritz-Carlton will manage opulent homes in the other. The towers are expertly slanted to provide each residence with breathtaking views of the sea, and the development flawless layout guarantees that residents will have the maximum discretion and privacy. Can't wait to call it home.\n\nOwner\n\nI have always dreamed of owning a perfect home, and finally, after purchasing an apartment in Three Sixty West, I am so happy. It is truly a dream come true. The location, the amenities, and the conveniences are amazing, and you can?t ask for more. My workplace is only a few kilometers away. Since it is so strategically located, it offers great connectivity to all IT hubs, including mine. It is truly a coveted address.\n\nOwner\n\nOberoi Hotels and Resorts Ltd. is the developer of the 284-unit luxury residential complex Oberoi Three Sixty West, Mumbai South. The property, which has 1.58 acres, offers a selection of 4 BHK?5 BHK homes in sizes ranging from 5500 to 6550 square feet. We recently bought a massive five-bedroom apartment. Compared to the other flats we saw when searching for a place to live in Mumbai, it is substantially larger. It also has many amenities.\n\nOwner\n\nThe abundance of amenities that this project provides for its residents is what I truly adore about it. The abundance of possibilities for those who enjoy sports and fitness is very appealing to me. I work out a lot in the gym, and I appreciate that I can work out there instead of having to go outside. You also enjoy spending time with your pets in the pet area, if you have one. Truly beautiful.\n\nOwner\n\nThere are so many conveniences at your disposal. Not only does it have high security and safety standards, but it also offers facilities like firefighting and an intercom. There is a cafe on its premises where you can hang out with your friends and family. We can also do so many sports activities on the premises. There is so much greenery here. The environment is so calm and serene. It is safe and well-lit at night.\n\nOwner\n\nMumbai Worli neighbourhood is home to Oberoi Three Sixty West. There are various unit sizes available for purchase. The homeowners have already received possession at Oberoi Three Sixty West, which is ready to move into. An array of sports amenities is undoubtedly offered by Oberoi Three Sixty West, including a gymnasium, swimming pool, children pool, tennis courts, badminton courts, squash courts, children play areas with sand pits, basketball, yoga areas, jogging/cycle track, and table tennis.\n\nOwner\n\nNot only does Three Sixty West offer you an opulent lifestyle, but it also complies with Vastu. It is positioned likewise, and this is something that I really like about my apartment. I am also happy with the fact that my apartment has a very spacious living room. The kitchen is also large, with contemporary furnishings and an ultra-modern layout. I really love it here. We also get fresh water all day. Great place to live.\n\n## Oberoi Realty Track Record\n\n![Oberoi Realty logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/oberoi-realty-589.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\n**Oberoi Three Sixty West** is proudly developed by **Oberoi Realty**, a builder with a significant track record of **35** completed residential developments. They bring a wealth of expertise, evidenced by **39** years of dedicated service in crafting quality homes and fostering vibrant communities. This commitment is reflected in their focus on family-oriented projects and a strong emphasis on homebuyer satisfaction. The developer's dedication to excellence is further underscored by an overall rating of **4.5**, built upon **10** customer reviews, signifying trust and a high standard of living.\n\n![Oberoi Oceanic residential project in Bandra West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-oberoi-oceanic-project-flagship-opt-f3508fe2-2446-4527-abc6-ba6ee2410101.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBandra West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3, 4, 5 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Oberoi Garden City residential project in Goregaon East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-oberoi-garden-city-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nGoregaon East, Mumbai\n\n2 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Oberoi Elysian Tower A residential project in Goregaon East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-oberoi-elysian-tower-a-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nGoregaon East, Mumbai\n\n3, 4 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 8.68 Cr to 15.40 Cr\n\n![Oberoi Sky City Tower E residential project in Borivali East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-oberoi-sky-city-tower-e-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 3.12 Cr to 3.18 Cr\n\n![Oberoi Sky City residential project in Borivali East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-oberoi-sky-city-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 5.43 Cr to 6.80 Cr\n\n![Oberoi Commerz residential project in Aarey Colony](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-oberoi-commerz-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nAarey Colony, Mumbai\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Oberoi Skyz residential project in Worli](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-oberoi-skyz-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Oberoi Chambers residential project in Andheri West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-oberoi-chambers-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nAndheri West, Mumbai\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Oberoi Beach House residential project in Juhu](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-oberoi-beach-house-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nJuhu, Mumbai\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Oberoi Garden Estates residential project in Powai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-oberoi-garden-estates-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nPowai, Mumbai\n\nOffice Space\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Oberoi Exquisite Goregaon residential project in Goregaon East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-oberoi-exquisite-goregaon-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;cr