bai/project-image/chandak-affinity-heights-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nLower Parel, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Lodha Vista residential project in Lower Parel](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lodha-vista-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nLower Parel, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 3.69 Cr to 8.44 Cr\n\n![JP Unity Tower residential project in Lower Parel](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/jp-unity-tower-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nLower Parel, Mumbai\n\n2 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.08 Cr to 1.78 Cr\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions About Oberoi Three Sixty West\n\n### Where exactly is Oberoi Three Sixty West located?\n\nOberoi Three Sixty West is in Worli, Mumbai, within the Mumbai South belt. The location gives residents access to Eastern Express Highway, Dr Annie Besant Road, keeping commutes to business districts and daily errands predictable without lengthy detours. Prabhadevi Municipal Primary School, Prabhadevi, Phoenix Palladium, Worli, Siddhivinayak Temple, Dahisar East, Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj Park, Shivaji Park are within reach, and the area carries a connectivity index of 4.1, a measurable indicator of how the location actually performs on a regular working day.\n\n### What is the starting price of Oberoi Three Sixty West?\n\nOberoi Three Sixty West is priced from ₹ 45.00 Cr, with the upper range reaching ₹ 57.17 Cr depending on the configuration and floor selected. The entry point covers the smallest available unit, while larger 4, 5 BHK Flats are priced at higher levels. Unit sizes run from 5235 Sq.Ft. to 6651 Sq.Ft..\n\n### Who is the developer of Oberoi Three Sixty West?\n\nOberoi Three Sixty West is developed by Oberoi Realty, a real estate company with 39 years in the industry and 35 projects completed across multiple cities. For buyers committing funds ahead of possession, a developer's execution track record carries more practical weight than marketing material. Oberoi Realty's delivery history and project scale give buyers a reasonable basis for evaluating construction quality and timeline credibility.\n\n### What configurations and unit sizes are available in Oberoi Three Sixty West?\n\nOberoi Three Sixty West offers 4, 5 BHK Flats with unit sizes ranging from 5235 Sq.Ft. to 6651 Sq.Ft.. This range covers compact layouts suited to individuals and couples as well as larger floor plans designed for families of four or more. Each configuration is planned with ventilation, natural light access and practical room separation in mind. Detailed 2D and 3D floor plans for every unit type are available in the floor plans section on this page.\n\n### Is Oberoi Three Sixty West RERA registered?\n\nYes. Oberoi Three Sixty West is registered under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act with RERA number P51900012115. This registration places the project's construction timeline, fund utilisation and possession date on public record with the state RERA authority. Buyers can verify the status and track construction progress directly on the state RERA portal using this number.\n\n### When is the possession date for Oberoi Three Sixty West?\n\nOberoi Three Sixty West is currently Ready to Move, with Mar 2019 registered as the possession date. This is a legally documented timeline filed with the state RERA authority under registration number P51900012115, not an advisory estimate. Buyers paying in advance of completion can verify construction progress against the registered milestones on the RERA portal at any point before taking possession.\n\n### What amenities are available at Oberoi Three Sixty West?\n\nOberoi Three Sixty West includes Gymnasium, Swimming Pool, Power Backup, Treated Water Supply, 24 x 7 Security, CCTV / Video Surveillance, Cafe / Coffee Bar, Party Hall, Rain Water Harvesting, Sewage Treatment Plant for regular resident use. The facilities are distributed across the development rather than concentrated in a single building, which keeps them accessible and practical during peak hours. Spaces cover multiple age groups and daily needs, from fitness and sports infrastructure to leisure zones and quieter areas for senior residents.\n\n### How well connected is Oberoi Three Sixty West to the rest of Mumbai?\n\nOberoi Three Sixty West at Worli Mumbai sits close to Eastern Express Highway, Dr Annie Besant Road, which handles most commute routes to employment hubs and commercial areas in Mumbai. Prabhadevi Municipal Primary School, Prabhadevi, Phoenix Palladium, Worli, Siddhivinayak Temple, Dahisar East, Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj Park, Shivaji Park are within a reasonable distance, and the area holds a connectivity index of 4.1.\n\n### What schools and banks are near Oberoi Three Sixty West?\n\nMedifit Medical Academy Mumbai HO Medifit Biologicals Limited, Prabhadevi Municipal Primary School, DY Patil International School, Greenlawns School, KGT International School are close to Oberoi Three Sixty West, which makes the project practical for families managing school runs alongside work commutes. Syndicate Bank, Rbl Bank, Idfc First Bank, Induslnd Bank, Andhra Bank are also nearby for routine financial needs, removing two of the more common location compromises families make when shortlisting areas. The locality's education and health index of 4.4 gives buyers a measurable read on the available social infrastructure before making a commitment.\n\n### Is Oberoi Three Sixty West a good investment?\n\nOberoi Three Sixty West sits in Worli, Mumbai, an area with a livability index of 4.1. The project is backed by Oberoi Realty's 39 years of delivery experience across 35 completed projects, which supports confidence in on-time possession.\n\n### How many homes are there in Oberoi Three Sixty West and how large is the project?\n\nOberoi Three Sixty West has 284 homes at Worli Mumbai. Unit sizes run from 5235 Sq.Ft. to 6651 Sq.Ft. across 4, 5 BHK Flats. The scale of the development means shared amenities, open spaces and community infrastructure are distributed across the layout rather than compressed into a single corner, which directly affects how accessible and usable the facilities are for residents on a day-to-day basis.\n\nThis website is only for the purpose of providing information regarding real estate projects in different geographies. Any information which is being provided on this website is not an advertisement or a solicitation. The company has not verified the information and the compliances of the projects. Further, the company has not checked the RERA\\* registration status of the real estate projects listed herein. The company does not make any representation in regards to the compliances done against these projects. Please note that you should make yourself aware about the RERA\\* registration status of the listed real estate projects.\n\n**\\*Real Estate (Regulation & Development) Act, 2016.**\n\n![Bangalore city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/bangalore.svg)\n![Chennai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/chennai.svg)\n![Delhi city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/delhi.svg)\n![Gurgaon city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/gurgaon.svg)\n![Hyderabad city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/hyderabad.svg)\n![Kolkata city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/kolkata.svg)\n![Lucknow city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/lucknow.svg)\n![Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/mumbai.svg)\n![Navi Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/navi-mumbai.svg)\n![Noida city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/noida.svg)\n![Pune city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/pune.svg)\n![Thane city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/thane.svg)\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.addressofchoice.com/oberoi-three-sixty-west-worli-mumbai-p73494","title":"Oberoi Three Sixty West Worli Mumbai - Reviews, Price, Address, Photos 2","raw_content":"![](https://www.facebook.com/tr?id=267087050525738&ev=PageView&noscript=1)\n![logo](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/logo.svg)\n![logo](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/logo-white.svg)\n\n## Oberoi Three Sixty West\n\n![location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/navigate-outline.svg)\n![Developer](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/business-outline.svg)\n\n![Location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/location-outline.svg)Worli, Mumbai.\n\n![Location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/location-outline.svg)\n![Google](https://www.google.com/favicon.ico)\n![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)\n![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg)\n\n###### 34.45 Cr to 43.76 Cr\\*\n\n![Oberoi Three Sixty West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/73494/1716289149_oberoi-eleva.jpg \"Oberoi Three Sixty West\")\n\n# Oberoi Three Sixty West in Worli, Mumbai Details | Reviews | Price | Floor Plan | Photos | Master Plan | Brochure | Amenities | Location\n\n![Master Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-master-plan.jpg \"Master Plan\")\n![Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-floor-plan.jpg \"Floor Plan\")\n![Site Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-site-plan.jpg \"Site Plan\")\n![Oberoi Three Sixty West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/73494/1716289149_oberoi-eleva.jpg \"Oberoi Three Sixty West\")\n![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)\n![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg)\n\n#### Are you interested in property?\n\nGet attractive benefits with addressofchoice.com\n\nStatus: **Ready to Move**\n\n![call](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/call-outline.svg)\n![home](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/conversation.svg)\n\n## About\n\n##### Excellent\n\nOberoi Three Sixty West is a remarkable Residential project located in the well-connected Worli locality of Mumbai. Spanning Details Available Upon Request, the project features Details Available Upon Request in Details Available Upon Request, offering a mix of 4 BHK+4T, to 5 BHK+5T Apartments ranging from 5235 sqft to 6651 sqft. The address for the project is worli, mumbai..\n\n**Available Property Sizes**\n\nThe Apartments at Oberoi Three Sixty West are available in a variety of sizes. The 4 BHK+4T units start at 5235 sqft. The larger 5 BHK+5T Apartments go up to 6651 sqft, providing ample space for families of all sizes.\n\n**Price Range**\n\nThe prices for the Apartments at Oberoi Three Sixty West are designed to be accessible, with 4 BHK+4T units priced from 34.45 Cr and 5 BHK+5T Apartments from 43.76 Cr, depending on the size and configuration.\n\n**Developer Information**\n\nThe project is being developed by Oberoi Realty, known for its commitment to quality and timely delivery. RERA registration number for the project is P51900012115 Units. Possession is expected to begin in 2024-01-18, ensuring that the property is well on track for future homeowners.\n\n**Amenities and Features**\n\nOberoi Three Sixty West is designed to offer a blend of luxury and convenience. Key sports amenities include a Kids Play Area, Swimming Pool, Gym. For relaxation, the development offers a Lifts, Car Parking, Power Back-up, Water Storage, Waste Disposal, Garden. The security features include CCTV for enhanced safety.\n\n**Construction and Specifications**\n\nThe project is constructed using premium materials such as vitrified tiles for flooring, granite countertops in the kitchens, and high-end sanitary ware in the bathrooms. These materials ensure both durability and elegance in every home.\n\n**Key Information**\n\n* Total Area: Details Available Upon Request\n* Units & Towers: Details Available Upon Request, Details Available Upon Request\n* Sizes: 5235 sqft to 6651 sqft\n* Project Address: worli, mumbai.\n* Type: Residential Apartments\n* Developer: Oberoi Realty\n* RERA Registration No.: P51900012115 Units\n* Possession Start: 2024-01-18\n* Construction Quality: Premium materials, vitrified tiles, granite countertops\n* Security: CCTV\n* Sports Facilities: Kids Play Area, Swimming Pool, Gym\n* Convenience Amenities: Lifts, Car Parking, Power Back-up, Water Storage, Waste Disposal, Garden\n\n**Location Benefits**\n\nOberoi Three Sixty West benefits from its location in Worli, offering great connectivity to schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and public transport systems. This makes it an ideal place to live, especially for families.\n\n**Developer and Project Details**\n\nPossession at Oberoi Three Sixty West will begin in 2024-01-18, and the project is RERA registered under P51900012115 Units. Developed by Oberoi Realty, this project promises a reliable investment for prospective homeowners.\n\nOberoi Three Sixty West is a remark